DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering יצחק בן אברהם וש
 רה\, whose Yahrzeit occurs on Tuesday\, November 26\, corresponding to t
 he 28th of Cheshvan\, 5780.\n\nיצחק בן אברהם ושרה’s Yahrz
 eit begins at sundown on Monday\, November 25 and continues until sundown 
 on the day of observance. It is customary to light a memorial candle at du
 sk as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your loved one’s soul be bound up in t
 he bond of eternal life and may their memory serve as a continued source o
 f inspiration and comfort to you.
