DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering לאה Leah\, whose Yahrzeit o
 ccurs on Saturday\, December 17\, corresponding to the 23rd of Kislev\, 57
 83.\n\nלאה Leah’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on Friday\, December 16 
 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. It is customary to l
 ight a memorial candle before sundown as the Yahrzeit begins.\n\nMay your 
 loved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and may their m
 emory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort to you.
END:VEVENT
